}

get {
  url: {{tomtomBase}}/traffic/services/5/incidentDetails?key={{tomtomKey}}&bbox=106.88,-6.46,107.47,-6.24&fields={incidents{type,geometry{type,coordinates},properties{iconCategory,magnitudeOfDelay,startTime,from,to,delay,roadNumbers,events{description,code}}}}&language=id-ID&timeValidityFilter=present
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  key: {{tomtomKey}}
  bbox: 106.88,-6.46,107.47,-6.24
  fields: {incidents{type,geometry{type,coordinates},properties{iconCategory,magnitudeOfDelay,startTime,from,to,delay,roadNumbers,events{description,code}}}}
  language: id-ID
  timeValidityFilter: present
}

docs {
  # GET TomTom · Incident Details (v5)

  Live traffic incidents within a bounding box. Fills the **Insiden (Laporan
  Publik)** feed. The server filters results to the Japek corridor (roadNumbers
  includes `AH2`, or text mentions Cikampek/Japek), keeps the top 6 by severity.

  **bbox:** `minLon,minLat,maxLon,maxLat` covering the Japek corridor + approaches.
  **language:** `id-ID` → descriptions come back in Indonesian.
  **Used by:** `fetchIncidents()` in `lib/jasamarga/tomtom.ts`
  **Free tier:** non-tile request; cached ~2 min with the flow data.

  ## Example response (real, abridged)
  ```json
  {
    "incidents": [
      {
        "type": "Feature",
        "geometry": { "type": "LineString", "coordinates": [ [106.8883, -6.2458], "..." ] },
        "properties": {
          "iconCategory": 6,
          "magnitudeOfDelay": 1,
          "startTime": "2026-05-29T03:14:30Z",
          "from": "Halim Perdana Kusumah",
          "to": "Jalan Tol Dalam Kota",
          "delay": 51,
          "roadNumbers": ["1", "AH2"],
          "events": [ { "code": 115, "description": "lalu lintas lambat" } ]
        }
      }
    ]
  }
  ```

  ## Field mapping → `IncidentItem`
  | TomTom | our field |
  |---|---|
  | iconCategory | `type` (1 Kecelakaan, 6 Kemacetan, 7/8 ditutup, 9 Perbaikan, 11 Banjir, 14 mogok) |
  | magnitudeOfDelay (+delay) | `severity` (0–10) |
  | geometry.coordinates[0] lon | `km` (estimated from longitude) |
  | events[0].description | `detail` |
  | (constant) | `source: "TomTom Traffic"` |

  > iconCategory codes: 0 unknown · 1 accident · 6 jam · 7 lane closed · 8 road closed · 9 roadworks · 11 flooding · 14 broken-down vehicle.
}
